# i18n locales

- Layout and namespaces: [contracts/i18n-locales.md](../../contracts/i18n-locales.md)
- Product copy: `locales/{locale}.json` (`ui`, `app`, `player`, `marketing`)
- Design system: `locales/bnd/{locale}.json` (`designsystem` only)
- Review titles/FAQs/transcripts: fixture JSON + `pickLocalized()` — not locale files
- Use `t("…")` from `@/lib/i18n`; add keys to JSON before wiring UI
